{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB日前釋出大型節目《萬千星輝賀台慶》司儀陣容宣傳片，由鎮台之寶汪明荃領軍12位司儀坐鎮。去年罕有缺席並捲入 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB日前釋出大型節目《萬千星輝賀台慶》司儀陣容宣傳片，由鎮台之寶汪明荃領軍12位司儀坐鎮。去年罕有缺席並捲入雪藏風波金牌司儀麥美恩確認強勢回歸，即將與風格迥異並曾傳出搶Cue疑雲女主持陳貝兒同台交鋒。兩大頂級女司儀狹路相逢同場較量，注定為這場年度盛事掀起一場無法預料震撼暗湧。</p>\n<h2>《萬千星輝賀台慶》司儀陣容強勢曝光</h2>\n<p>電視台於11月6日公開《萬千星輝賀台慶》最新宣傳片段，正式揭曉今年度重量級司儀陣容。片段中確認由汪明荃負責壓場領軍大局，帶領洪永城、林溥來、朱凱婷、鄭衍峰、陸浩明、周奕瑋、林秀怡、孔德賢及潘靜文等多位跨世代主持同台亮相。當中全場最大焦點落在去年意外缺席而引發被公司雪藏傳聞麥美恩身上，她今年終於強勢重返台慶大舞台，粉碎外界對其事業停滯各種猜測。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943708051477860_10448393786af3ecf592801.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-TVB2026-YouTube-0’14”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943708051477860_10448393786af3ecf592801.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179437080770321757_20892536af3ecf830fd4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-TVB2026-YouTube-0’34”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179437080770321757_20892536af3ecf830fd4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>司儀陣容強勢曝光（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民熱烈期待《萬千星輝賀台慶》經典畫面</h2>\n<p>麥美恩重返台慶司儀席消息一出，隨即在網絡上引發極大迴響。不少觀眾對其招牌動作夾胸攬念念不忘，回顧2021年李芷晴及2023年郭珮文贏取42萬大獎時，均被其施展壓胸式擁抱締造出黃金畫面。大批網民紛紛押注今年哪位幸運兒會再度被她夾胸鎖喉，留言表示「冇咗麥美恩嘅台慶會唔會少咗啲笑料」、「期待今年邊個會被夾胸攬」。觀眾對於兩位女司儀再度同台同樣充滿好奇，熱切討論這場一剛一柔專業碰撞。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175691225236245017_179862106168b85a7cb6c64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"麥美恩 被雪傳聞 李芷晴在TVB台慶奪得年度大獎，極速引起網民熱議！（圖片來源：TVB ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175691225236245017_179862106168b85a7cb6c64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李芷晴在TVB台慶奪得年度大獎，極速引起網民熱議！（圖片來源：TVB ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/176371412269973568_14311403546920244b4deef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"麥美恩 被雪傳聞 麥美恩仲開心過佢！（圖片來源：TVB截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/176371412269973568_14311403546920244b4deef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>麥美恩仲開心過佢！（圖片來源：TVB截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/vs-mytvsuper-2886715945-1_864452286673cb29f609a6-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"麥美恩 被雪傳聞 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/vs-mytvsuper-2886715945-1_864452286673cb29f609a6-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>麥美恩陳貝兒於《香港小姐競選決賽》掀爭議</h2>\n<p>麥美恩與陳貝兒在主持界一直被外界視為爭奪一姐寶座潛在對手。兩人風格截然不同，前者憑藉搞怪靈活親民形象帶動全場氣氛，後者則以知性優雅及溫情穩健路線見稱。雙方暗戰源於2024年《香港小姐競選決賽》全女班司儀陣容，當時兩人在宣布三甲關鍵時刻，陳貝兒被指疑似伸手觸碰麥美恩手上賽果卡並試圖接話，引爆一場搶Cue羅生門。加上當晚紅地毯進場節奏出現落差，令這對頂級司儀之間競爭關係浮出水面。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179437081057410925_21316334996af3ecfae42ad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-TVB2026-YouTube-0’04”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179437081057410925_21316334996af3ecfae42ad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>與「宿敵」陳貝兒再同台（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%b2%9d%e5%85%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳貝兒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%ba%a5%e7%be%8e%e6%81%a9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">麥美恩</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540182\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:33:41.462752+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1246,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:20:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:19.222260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:19.222260+00:00","content_hash":"bb0a18be229c8f2991d8f1587109786e98b7569ebdbc321a90f8f4e48d17fc79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}